---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="Digital Entity Setup — BitEvo Advisory Concept" description="Digital Entity Setup is a BitEvo advisory concept, not a standardized current public package." robots="noindex, follow">
  <section class="concept-hero section">
    <div class="container hero-grid">
      <div><div class="eyebrow">Advisory concept · not standardized</div><h1 class="display">Digital Entity Setup</h1></div>
      <div><p class="lede">Architecture work for people operating across many AI tools: memory boundaries, workflow routing, handoffs and durable operating context. This route is retained as a concept page, not a current fixed-price public package.</p></div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section-tight section-rule">
    <div class="container concept-grid">
      <article class="panel"><span>Problem</span><h2>Scattered context</h2><p>Repeated context loss, duplicated work and weak handoffs across chats, tools and agent surfaces.</p></article>
      <article class="panel"><span>Architecture</span><h2>Explicit memory rules</h2><p>Separate durable records, transient task context, preferences and authority-sensitive state instead of treating one chat history as an operating system.</p></article>
      <article class="panel"><span>Boundary</span><h2>Context is not authority</h2><p>Persistent memory can support decisions, but it does not itself authorize tool execution, production changes, spending or other consequential effects.</p></article>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section section-rule">
    <div class="narrow current">
      <div class="eyebrow">Current public path</div>
      <h2 class="section-title">Use the services page for active engagements.</h2>
      <p class="lede">BitEvo’s standardized current public offer is the Agent Authority & Evidence Audit. Broader architecture work is scoped only when there is a concrete bounded problem to solve.</p>
      <div class="actions"><a class="button button-primary" href="/consulting">Current services <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a><a class="button" href="/continuityos">ContinuityOS</a></div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>

<style>
  .concept-hero{padding-top:clamp(78px,10vw,132px)}.hero-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:clamp(40px,8vw,110px);align-items:end}.hero-grid .lede{margin:0}.concept-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:16px}.concept-grid article{padding:28px;min-height:250px;display:flex;flex-direction:column}.concept-grid article>span{color:var(--green);font:500 .62rem var(--mono);letter-spacing:.1em;text-transform:uppercase}.concept-grid h2{margin:auto 0 10px;font-size:1.2rem}.concept-grid p{margin:0;color:var(--muted);font-size:.84rem}.current{text-align:center}.current .section-title{margin-inline:auto}.current .lede{margin:18px auto 28px}.actions{display:flex;gap:10px;justify-content:center;flex-wrap:wrap}@media(max-width:820px){.hero-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}.concept-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}.concept-grid article{min-height:190px}}
</style>
